; atleast_k_range_beats_sample_mode: k is range-checked before the model
; register is discriminated.
;
; exec_at_least resolves the indices vec and rejects k <= 0 before it ever
; looks at what r0 holds, so a sample register with k = 0 raises
; IndexOutOfBounds. xqvm_py checked the mode first and raised XqmxMode.
;
; This is outside SPEC.md's XqmxMode carve-out, which licenses XqmxMode
; against TypeMismatch for the same program. Here the Rust VM never reaches
; its register check at all, so the disagreement was over which rule fired
; rather than what to call the mode fault.

PUSH 4
BSMX r0          ; a sample, not a model

VEC r2
PUSH 1
VECPUSH r2

PUSH 0           ; k = 0, outside [1, n]
PUSH 1           ; penalty
ATLEAST r0 r2
HALT
